<title>UK: ICI up on ADR rally, analysts meeting.</title>
<headline>ICI up on ADR rally, analysts meeting.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Imperial Chemical Industries Plc jumped to a record on Thursday, tracking strength in their ADRs, after the company impressed analysts at a meeting in the U.S. on Wednesday, dealers said.</p>
<p>The shares were up 20-1/2p at 0838 GMT to 997, just 3p off their peak set earlier.</p>
<p>The ADRs added $2-1/2 to $65-3/4 overnight.  </p>
<p>The company was not immediately able to provide details of the meeting.</p>
<p>ICI shares advanced on Wednesday after Merrill Lynch reiterated an &quot;accumulate&quot; on the stock, saying that the group's restructuring was occurring faster than expected.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
